  "description": "The property currently benefits from a rear conservatory extending 3.6 metres in depth, alongside a shaded area with a polycarbonate roof, which serves to provide ventilation and natural light to the existing kitchen window. The proposal seeks to replace the existing conservatory with a single-storey rear extension, also extending 3.6 metres in depth, with a maximum height of 3 metres. The width of the proposed extension will match that of the existing conservatory. The adjacent shaded area is to be retained in its current form to continue facilitating ventilation and daylight to the proposed new bathroom window.",
